# Variable Compensation Rules

## Architecture
- Follow Host → Api → Application → Domain ← Infrastructure
- No business logic in controllers
- All writes via MediatR Commands; reads via Queries
- Domain project must not reference EF Core or ASP.NET

## Naming
- Commands: `AddEmployeeCommand`, `SubmitEvaluationCommand`
- Handlers: `AddEmployeeCommandHandler`
- Domain events: `EvaluationSubmitted`, `EvaluationApproved`

## Evaluation module
- `Evaluation` is the aggregate root
- Status changes only through domain methods or dedicated handlers
- One evaluation per employee per year/quarter (enforced in DB and domain)

## Database
- PostgreSQL via EF Core
- Use migrations; never alter production schema manually
- Table names: snake_case plural

## Security
- Never store plain-text passwords
- Use JWT for API auth (when implemented)
